#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "Connector for VozCaster"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "https://vozcaster.com"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid ""
"Connect your WordPress to the VozCaster Telegram bot — publish podcast "
"episodes from voice notes directly into PowerPress."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "Miguel Ángel Terrón Bote"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: connector-for-vozcaster.php
msgid "https://potencia.pro"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:60
msgid ""
"The content of this post was generated automatically with artificial "
"intelligence from the audio transcript. It may contain errors or "
"inaccuracies."
msgstr ""
"El contenido de este post ha sido generado automáticamente con inteligencia "
"artificial a partir de la transcripción del audio. Puede contener errores o "
"imprecisiones."

#. translators: 1: link to the VozCaster website, 2: link to the Telegram bot.
#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:128
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Published with %1$s, the Telegram bot that turns your voice into a published"
" podcast episode. %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Publicado con %1$s, el bot de Telegram que convierte tu voz en un episodio "
"de podcast publicado. %2$s."

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:130
msgid "Try it free"
msgstr "Pruébalo gratis"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:144 includes/class-pairing.php:95
#: includes/class-settings.php:49 includes/class-settings.php:50
#: includes/class-settings.php:363
msgid "VozCaster"
msgstr "VozCaster"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:156
msgid "This post was written with AI from the audio of the episode."
msgstr "Este post se ha escrito con IA a partir del audio del episodio."

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:159
msgid "Hide the AI notice on this post"
msgstr "Ocultar el aviso de IA en este post"

#: includes/class-ai-notice.php:162
msgid ""
"The AI notice is turned off for the whole site in Settings → VozCaster."
msgstr ""
"El aviso de IA está desactivado para toda la web en Ajustes → VozCaster."

#: includes/class-api.php:1294
msgid "No file received."
msgstr "No se ha recibido ningún archivo."

#. translators: %s: the rejected MIME content type.
#: includes/class-api.php:1331
#, php-format
msgid "File type not allowed: %s"
msgstr "Tipo de archivo no permitido: %s"

#: includes/class-auth.php:224
msgid "Invalid parameters."
msgstr "Parámetros inválidos."

#: includes/class-auth.php:225
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

#: includes/class-auth.php:264
msgid "Link expired"
msgstr "Enlace caducado"

#: includes/class-auth.php:265
msgid "This authorization link has expired (10 minutes)."
msgstr "El enlace de autorización ha caducado (10 minutos)."

#. translators: %s: the /conectar bot command, wrapped in a <code> tag.
#: includes/class-auth.php:268
#, php-format
msgid "Go back to the bot and use %s again."
msgstr "Vuelve al bot y usa %s de nuevo."

#: includes/class-auth.php:274
msgid "VozCaster — Link expired"
msgstr "VozCaster — Enlace caducado"

#: includes/class-auth.php:281
msgid "Not authorized"
msgstr "No autorizado"

#. translators: %s: the WordPress username, wrapped in a <strong> tag.
#: includes/class-auth.php:284
#, php-format
msgid "The role of %s is not authorized to publish from VozCaster."
msgstr "El perfil de %s no está autorizado a publicar desde VozCaster."

#. translators: %s: the plugin settings location, wrapped in an <em> tag.
#: includes/class-auth.php:289
#, php-format
msgid "Ask the administrator to authorize your role under %s."
msgstr "Pide al administrador que autorice tu perfil en %s."

#: includes/class-auth.php:290
msgid "Settings → VozCaster"
msgstr "Ajustes → VozCaster"

#: includes/class-auth.php:295
msgid "VozCaster — Not authorized"
msgstr "VozCaster — No autorizado"

#: includes/class-auth.php:315
msgid "Connected!"
msgstr "¡Conectado!"

#. translators: %s: the user's display name, wrapped in a <strong> tag.
#: includes/class-auth.php:318
#, php-format
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "Hola, %s."

#: includes/class-auth.php:321
msgid "You can now go back to the Telegram bot and continue."
msgstr "Ya puedes volver al bot de Telegram y continuar."

#: includes/class-auth.php:325
msgid "VozCaster — Connection completed"
msgstr "VozCaster — Conexión completada"

#: includes/class-auth.php:346
msgid "Back to the Telegram bot"
msgstr "Volver al bot de Telegram"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:94 includes/class-pairing.php:115
#: includes/class-pairing.php:234
msgid "Connect with VozCaster"
msgstr "Conectar con VozCaster"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:117
msgid ""
"VozCaster is a Telegram bot that turns your voice notes into published "
"podcast episodes on this site. Connect your account once and publish from "
"Telegram."
msgstr ""
"VozCaster es un bot de Telegram que convierte tus notas de voz en episodios "
"de podcast publicados en esta web. Conecta tu cuenta una vez y publica desde"
" Telegram."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:122
msgid ""
"PowerPress is not active. Install and activate it before connecting, so "
"episodes reach your podcast feed."
msgstr ""
"PowerPress no está activo. Instálalo y actívalo antes de conectar, para que "
"los episodios lleguen al feed de tu podcast."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:128
msgid ""
"Your account is already connected to the bot. Connecting again replaces the "
"previous connection, and with several podcasts it switches the one you "
"publish to."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuenta ya está conectada al bot. Si vuelves a conectar, se sustituye la "
"conexión anterior y, si hay varios podcasts, cambias a aquel en el que "
"publicas."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:144
msgid "Connect in Telegram"
msgstr "Conectar en Telegram"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:153
msgid ""
"Telegram opens with the bot. Press Start and confirm the connection there. "
"The link works once and expires in 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Se abre Telegram con el bot. Pulsa Iniciar y confirma allí la conexión. El "
"enlace sirve una sola vez y caduca en 15 minutos."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:157
msgid ""
"The address of this site cannot be passed to the bot automatically. Open the"
" bot, send /conectar and paste this address:"
msgstr ""
"La dirección de esta web no se puede pasar al bot automáticamente. Abre el "
"bot, envía /conectar y pega esta dirección:"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:162
msgid "Open the bot in Telegram"
msgstr "Abrir el bot en Telegram"

#: includes/class-pairing.php:178
msgid "Your role is not authorized to publish from VozCaster."
msgstr "Tu perfil no está autorizado a publicar desde VozCaster."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:230
msgid "Publish your podcast from Telegram."
msgstr "Publica tu podcast desde Telegram."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:231
msgid "Connect your account with the VozCaster bot in one click."
msgstr "Conecta tu cuenta con el bot de VozCaster en un clic."

#: includes/class-pairing.php:235
msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "Descartar"

#: includes/class-settings.php:40
msgid "Select intro audio"
msgstr "Selecciona el audio de intro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:41
msgid "Select outro audio"
msgstr "Selecciona el audio de outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:42
msgid "Select"
msgstr "Seleccionar"

#: includes/class-settings.php:162
msgid "No file selected."
msgstr "No se ha seleccionado ningún archivo."

#: includes/class-settings.php:258
msgid "Invalid attachment."
msgstr "Adjunto no válido."

#: includes/class-settings.php:288
msgid "AI notice settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes del aviso de IA guardados."

#: includes/class-settings.php:289
msgid "Authorized roles updated."
msgstr "Perfiles autorizados actualizados."

#: includes/class-settings.php:290
msgid "Bot access revoked. The user will need to connect again."
msgstr "Acceso al bot revocado. El usuario tendrá que volver a conectarse."

#: includes/class-settings.php:291
msgid "Intro file deleted."
msgstr "Archivo de intro borrado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:292
msgid "Outro file deleted."
msgstr "Archivo de outro borrado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:293
msgid "Intro file uploaded successfully."
msgstr "Archivo de intro subido correctamente."

#: includes/class-settings.php:294
msgid "Outro file uploaded successfully."
msgstr "Archivo de outro subido correctamente."

#: includes/class-settings.php:295
msgid "Error uploading intro file. Please make sure it is a valid audio file."
msgstr ""
"Error al subir el archivo de intro. Asegúrate de que es un archivo de audio "
"válido."

#: includes/class-settings.php:296
msgid "Error uploading outro file. Please make sure it is a valid audio file."
msgstr ""
"Error al subir el archivo de outro. Asegúrate de que es un archivo de audio "
"válido."

#: includes/class-settings.php:297
msgid "Episode history cleared."
msgstr "Historial de episodios borrado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:298
msgid "Mix settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes de mezcla guardados."

#: includes/class-settings.php:299
msgid "Title settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes de títulos guardados."

#: includes/class-settings.php:300
msgid "Post footer saved."
msgstr "Pie de post guardado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:301
msgid "Image style saved."
msgstr "Estilo de imagen guardado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:366
msgid "PowerPress"
msgstr "PowerPress"

#: includes/class-settings.php:369
msgid "PowerPress is installed and active."
msgstr "PowerPress está instalado y activo."

#: includes/class-settings.php:371
msgid ""
"PowerPress is not installed or not active. Episodes will be created without "
"podcast data."
msgstr ""
"PowerPress no está instalado o no está activo. Los episodios se crearán sin "
"datos de podcast."

#: includes/class-settings.php:378
msgid "Who can publish from the bot"
msgstr "Quién puede publicar desde el bot"

#: includes/class-settings.php:380
msgid ""
"Users with the following roles are authorized to publish from the Telegram "
"bot, in every podcast of this site. They connect with their usual WordPress "
"account; no password goes through Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios con los siguientes perfiles están autorizados a publicar desde "
"el bot de Telegram, en todos los podcasts de esta web. Se conectan con su "
"cuenta de WordPress de siempre; ninguna contraseña pasa por Telegram."

#: includes/class-settings.php:387
msgid "Authorized roles"
msgstr "Perfiles autorizados"

#: includes/class-settings.php:400
msgid "always authorized"
msgstr "siempre autorizado"

#: includes/class-settings.php:406
msgid ""
"By default, every role that can publish posts (Author or above). A custom "
"role checked here can publish from the bot even if it cannot publish from "
"wp-admin."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, todos los perfiles que pueden publicar entradas (Autor o "
"superior). Un perfil propio marcado aquí puede publicar desde el bot aunque "
"no pueda publicar desde wp-admin."

#: includes/class-settings.php:408
msgid "Save roles"
msgstr "Guardar perfiles"

#: includes/class-settings.php:411
msgid "Connected users"
msgstr "Usuarios conectados"

#: includes/class-settings.php:413
msgid ""
"Each authorized user connects their own account from Users → VozCaster "
"(Profile → VozCaster for non-administrators)."
msgstr ""
"Cada usuario autorizado conecta su propia cuenta desde Usuarios → VozCaster "
"(Perfil → VozCaster si no es administrador)."

#: includes/class-settings.php:414
msgid "Connect your account"
msgstr "Conectar tu cuenta"

#: includes/class-settings.php:417
msgid "Nobody has connected the bot to this site yet."
msgstr "Todavía nadie ha conectado el bot a esta web."

#: includes/class-settings.php:422
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Usuario"

#: includes/class-settings.php:423
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nombre"

#: includes/class-settings.php:424
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Rol"

#: includes/class-settings.php:425
msgid "Bot status"
msgstr "Estado del bot"

#: includes/class-settings.php:443
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Conectado"

#: includes/class-settings.php:445
msgid "Role not authorized"
msgstr "Perfil no autorizado"

#: includes/class-settings.php:456
msgid "Revoke access? The user will need to connect again."
msgstr "¿Revocar el acceso? El usuario tendrá que volver a conectarse."

#: includes/class-settings.php:457
msgid "Revoke"
msgstr "Revocar"

#: includes/class-settings.php:470
msgid "AI content notice"
msgstr "Aviso de contenido generado con IA"

#: includes/class-settings.php:472
msgid ""
"When the bot writes the text of a post with AI, a short notice is shown with"
" it so readers know. It is added when the post is displayed, so changes here"
" apply to every post published from the bot. It can also be hidden on a "
"single post from the editor."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el bot escribe con IA el texto de un post, se muestra con él un breve"
" aviso para que los lectores lo sepan. Se añade al mostrar el post, así que "
"los cambios de aquí se aplican a todos los posts publicados desde el bot. "
"También se puede ocultar en un post concreto desde el editor."

#: includes/class-settings.php:480
msgid "Show the AI notice"
msgstr "Mostrar el aviso de IA"

#: includes/class-settings.php:484
msgid "Show it on posts whose text was written by AI"
msgstr "Mostrarlo en los posts cuyo texto ha escrito la IA"

#: includes/class-settings.php:490
msgid "Notice text"
msgstr "Texto del aviso"

#: includes/class-settings.php:494
msgid ""
"Leave it empty to use the default text (shown greyed out in the box), in the"
" language of the site. Basic HTML such as links is allowed."
msgstr ""
"Déjalo vacío para usar el texto por defecto (el que se ve en gris dentro de "
"la caja), en el idioma de la web. Se admite HTML básico, como enlaces."

#: includes/class-settings.php:499
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Posición"

#: includes/class-settings.php:503
msgid "At the end of the post"
msgstr "Al final del post"

#: includes/class-settings.php:504
msgid "At the beginning of the post"
msgstr "Al principio del post"

#: includes/class-settings.php:509
msgid "VozCaster credit"
msgstr "Crédito de VozCaster"

#: includes/class-settings.php:513
msgid ""
"Show a \"Published with VozCaster\" line with a link under posts published "
"from the bot"
msgstr ""
"Mostrar una línea «Publicado con VozCaster» con enlace bajo los posts "
"publicados desde el bot"

#: includes/class-settings.php:515
msgid "Off by default. Turning it on helps VozCaster grow — thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto. Activarlo ayuda a que VozCaster crezca. ¡Gracias!"

#: includes/class-settings.php:519
msgid "Save notice settings"
msgstr "Guardar ajustes del aviso"

#: includes/class-settings.php:525
msgid "Episode titles"
msgstr "Títulos de los episodios"

#: includes/class-settings.php:527
msgid ""
"Define the prefix prepended to the number and title of each episode. Can "
"also be changed from the Telegram bot with /settings."
msgstr ""
"Define el prefijo que se añade delante del número y el título de cada "
"episodio. También se puede cambiar desde el bot de Telegram con /settings."

#: includes/class-settings.php:536
msgid "Title prefix"
msgstr "Prefijo del título"

#: includes/class-settings.php:542
msgid "E.g.: Chapter, Episode, Ep."
msgstr "Ej.: Capítulo, Episodio, Ep."

#: includes/class-settings.php:546
msgid ""
"Empty = no prefix. With prefix and no season: «Chapter 15: Title». With "
"season: «Chapter T2E15: Title»."
msgstr ""
"Vacío = sin prefijo. Con prefijo y sin temporada: «Capítulo 15: Título». Con"
" temporada: «Capítulo T2E15: Título»."

#: includes/class-settings.php:551
msgid "Include season number"
msgstr "Incluir número de temporada"

#: includes/class-settings.php:558
msgid "Include T2E15 in the title (if a prefix is defined)"
msgstr "Incluir T2E15 en el título (si hay un prefijo definido)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:564
msgid "Current season"
msgstr "Temporada actual"

#: includes/class-settings.php:571
msgid "auto"
msgstr "automática"

#. translators: %d: the season number currently stored.
#: includes/class-settings.php:578
#, php-format
msgid "Stored season: %d. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Temporada guardada: %d. Déjalo en blanco para mantenerla."

#: includes/class-settings.php:580
msgid "Not set — the season is derived from the latest published episode."
msgstr "Sin fijar — la temporada se deduce del último episodio publicado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:584
msgid "Changing this is a big change:"
msgstr "Cambiar esto es un cambio importante:"

#: includes/class-settings.php:585
msgid ""
"the next episode is numbered within the target season (E1 if it has no "
"published episodes yet, otherwise it continues from the last one published "
"in it), and the <itunes:season> tag in the RSS feed changes (Apple Podcasts,"
" Spotify). Moving to a season below the latest published episode also "
"requires editing that episode in PowerPress."
msgstr ""
"el próximo episodio se numera dentro de la temporada de destino (E1 si aún "
"no tiene episodios publicados, o si no continúa desde el último publicado en"
" ella) y cambia la etiqueta <itunes:season> del feed RSS (Apple Podcasts, "
"Spotify). Pasar a una temporada por debajo del último episodio publicado "
"requiere editar además ese episodio en PowerPress."

#: includes/class-settings.php:591
msgid "Chapter numbering in title"
msgstr "Numeración del capítulo en el título"

#: includes/class-settings.php:598
msgid "Chapter within the season (resets at T1, T2…)"
msgstr "Capítulo dentro de la temporada (se reinicia en T1, T2…)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:599
msgid "Example: «Chapter 5: Title» even if it is episode 37 overall."
msgstr "Ejemplo: «Capítulo 5: Título» aunque sea el episodio 37 en total."

#: includes/class-settings.php:605
msgid "Global sequential number (inferred from the previous post title)"
msgstr "Número secuencial global (inferido del título del post anterior)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:606
msgid ""
"Example: «Chapter 38: Title». PowerPress still uses the chapter within the "
"season internally."
msgstr ""
"Ejemplo: «Capítulo 38: Título». PowerPress sigue usando internamente el "
"capítulo dentro de la temporada."

#: includes/class-settings.php:612
msgid "Save title settings"
msgstr "Guardar ajustes de títulos"

#: includes/class-settings.php:618
msgid "Intro &amp; Outro"
msgstr "Intro y outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:620
msgid ""
"Upload your intro and outro audio files here. They can also be uploaded from"
" the Telegram bot via the Intro/Outro menu."
msgstr ""
"Sube aquí tus archivos de audio de intro y outro. También se pueden subir "
"desde el bot de Telegram en el menú Intro/Outro."

#: includes/class-settings.php:624
msgid "Intro"
msgstr "Intro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:636
msgid "Delete the intro file?"
msgstr "¿Borrar el archivo de intro?"

#: includes/class-settings.php:637 includes/class-settings.php:678
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Borrar"

#: includes/class-settings.php:641
msgid "To replace the intro, upload a new file:"
msgstr "Para reemplazar la intro, sube un nuevo archivo:"

#: includes/class-settings.php:643
msgid "No intro loaded."
msgstr "No hay intro cargada."

#: includes/class-settings.php:649
msgid "Intro audio file"
msgstr "Archivo de audio de la intro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:651
msgid "Replace intro"
msgstr "Reemplazar intro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:651
msgid "Upload intro"
msgstr "Subir intro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:660 includes/class-settings.php:701
msgid "Select from media library"
msgstr "Seleccionar de la biblioteca multimedia"

#: includes/class-settings.php:665
msgid "Outro"
msgstr "Outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:677
msgid "Delete the outro file?"
msgstr "¿Borrar el archivo de outro?"

#: includes/class-settings.php:682
msgid "To replace the outro, upload a new file:"
msgstr "Para reemplazar el outro, sube un nuevo archivo:"

#: includes/class-settings.php:684
msgid "No outro loaded."
msgstr "No hay outro cargado."

#: includes/class-settings.php:690
msgid "Outro audio file"
msgstr "Archivo de audio del outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:692
msgid "Replace outro"
msgstr "Reemplazar outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:692
msgid "Upload outro"
msgstr "Subir outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:710
msgid "Audio mix settings (intro/outro)"
msgstr "Ajustes de mezcla de audio (intro/outro)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:712
msgid ""
"Define how intro and outro music is mixed with the podcast audio. These are "
"the default values and can be changed from the Telegram bot."
msgstr ""
"Define cómo se mezclan la intro y el outro con el audio del podcast. Son los"
" valores por defecto y se pueden cambiar desde el bot de Telegram."

#: includes/class-settings.php:721
msgid "Intro duck-in second"
msgstr "Segundo de inicio del duck de la intro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:728 includes/class-settings.php:784
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "segundos"

#: includes/class-settings.php:729
msgid ""
"The intro plays at 100% until this second. From here it starts fading down "
"and the podcast voice fades in."
msgstr ""
"La intro suena al 100% hasta este segundo. A partir de aquí empieza a bajar "
"y la voz del podcast entra en fade-in."

#: includes/class-settings.php:734
msgid "Intro volume under podcast"
msgstr "Volumen de la intro bajo el podcast"

#: includes/class-settings.php:742
msgid ""
"Volume to which the intro fades during duck-in, before reaching 0. Example: "
"30 = intro fades to 30% while the voice comes in."
msgstr ""
"Volumen al que baja la intro durante el duck, antes de llegar a 0. Ejemplo: "
"30 = la intro baja al 30% mientras entra la voz."

#: includes/class-settings.php:747
msgid "Second at which intro reaches 0"
msgstr "Segundo en el que la intro llega a 0"

#: includes/class-settings.php:755
msgid "seconds (empty = until the end of the intro file)"
msgstr "segundos (vacío = hasta el final del archivo de intro)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:756
msgid ""
"Exact second at which the intro reaches silence. If left empty, the fade "
"lasts until the end of the intro file."
msgstr ""
"Segundo exacto en el que la intro llega al silencio. Si se deja vacío, el "
"fade dura hasta el final del archivo de intro."

#: includes/class-settings.php:761
msgid "Knee: seconds to reach duck volume"
msgstr "Rodilla: segundos para llegar al volumen del duck"

#: includes/class-settings.php:769
msgid "seconds after duck start (empty = linear)"
msgstr "segundos después del inicio del duck (vacío = lineal)"

#: includes/class-settings.php:771
msgid ""
"Seconds after the duck start at which the intro has already dropped to the "
"duck volume %. A short value (e.g. 1) gives a sharp initial drop followed by"
" a long gentle tail. The outro uses the exact mirror curve automatically. "
"Leave empty for a linear fade."
msgstr ""
"Segundos después del inicio del duck en los que la intro ya ha bajado al % "
"del duck. Un valor corto (ej. 1) da una caída inicial rápida seguida de una "
"cola larga y suave. El outro usa automáticamente la curva espejo exacta. "
"Déjalo vacío para un fade lineal."

#: includes/class-settings.php:777
msgid "Seconds before end for outro fade-in"
msgstr "Segundos antes del final para el fade-in del outro"

#: includes/class-settings.php:785
msgid ""
"The outro starts playing in the background this many seconds before the "
"podcast voice ends. When the voice ends, it rises to 100%."
msgstr ""
"El outro empieza a sonar en segundo plano estos segundos antes de que "
"termine la voz del podcast. Cuando la voz acaba, sube al 100%."

#: includes/class-settings.php:790
msgid "Outro volume under podcast"
msgstr "Volumen del outro bajo el podcast"

#: includes/class-settings.php:798
msgid ""
"Maximum volume of the outro while the podcast voice is still playing. When "
"the voice ends, the outro rises to 100%."
msgstr ""
"Volumen máximo del outro mientras la voz del podcast sigue sonando. Cuando "
